title: "Survival Prediction in Metastatic Breast Cancer Phase II Trials"
abstract: "Code and data for examining endpoint correlations and developing interpretable machine learning models to predict median progression-free survival (mPFS) and median overall survival (mOS) from phase II trial data in advanced breast cancer."
